  cardText: '(stand-in until Grandma''s own card is added)


    Pickled Garlic


    About
    20 peeled cloves for each pint (two heads).

    A head of dill and a pinch
    of peppercorns in each jar.

    Hot brine to the line: equal parts water and
    vinegar, two scoops of salt.

    Water bath, 10 minutes.'
